  "id": "beef-and-beet-borscht",
  "name": "Beef and Beet Borscht",
  "subtitle": "A hearty beet soup with tender beef and fresh dill",
  "description": "Beef shank simmers with aromatic vegetables, beets, and cabbage, then finishes with vinegar, sour cream, and dill.",
